## Implementation Notes for Codex (P1)

- Timeframe: M5
- DWX symbols: **EURUSD.DWX, GBPUSD.DWX, USDJPY.DWX**
- BB(20,2): `iBands(NULL,0,20,2,0,PRICE_CLOSE,MODE_UPPER/LOWER,i)`
- SHORT setup: `Close[1] > upper[1] && Close[0] < upper[0]` → signal bar = bar[0]
- Pending SELLSTOP at `Low[0] - 5*Point`; expiry = current bar open + period (expire on next tick if bar[0] has already closed)
- Note: pending order must be placed AFTER bar[0] closes, at the next bar's open
- SL SHORT: `High[0] + 5*Point`; TP: `entry - 20*Point` (20 pips)
- BE: move SL to entry when profit >= 10*Point
- Session filter: `Hour(Time[0]) >= 8 && Hour(Time[0]) <= 11` (London) or `Hour(Time[0]) >= 13 && Hour(Time[0]) <= 16` (NY) — broker time GMT+2/+3
- Cancel pending if new BB pierce signals opposite direction
- P3 sweeps: BB period (14 vs 20 vs 30), TP (10 vs 20 vs 30 pips), session filter (with vs without D1 trend).

